meta {
  name: Numbers numbersDirectoryListingDelete
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v2.2/numbers/:number/directory-listing
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  number: <number>
}

docs {
**Remove the directory listing**
Removes the listing (202, status removing, applied in the background), or cancels an add that has not been applied yet (status not_listed). Billing for the listing stops at once.

Returns **204 No Content** on success — no response body.

OperationId: `numbersDirectoryListingDelete`
}
